body = "## While you are away\nThe lab keeps running at {OFFLINE_EFF:pct} efficiency, for up to {OFFLINE_CAP:h}.\n## On your return\nA summary shows what was earned while you were away. Random events do not happen while you are away, so none are waiting for you."
